abstract: >-
  SynPhytica is a hybrid computational framework (Python/Rust) designed to optimize 
  phytotherapeutic formulations using Multi-Objective Evolutionary Algorithms (NSGA-II) 
  and Transformer-based neural networks. It addresses the complexity of the "Entourage Effect" 
  by modeling molecular synergy as a linguistic problem, enabling the generation of 
  Pareto-optimal formulations tailored to specific patient profiles and therapeutic goals.
